RT_WIDGET&quot;'-0334177030835108END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_BloodMerchant_DesperateCitizen</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_BloodMerchant_DesperateCitizen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_BloodMerchant_DesperateCitizen\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">78b44318-8503-491c-a45f-aa23f4959725</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:78b44318-8503-491c-a45f-aa23f4959725\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:78b44318-8503-491c-a45f-aa23f4959725\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the mailbox of <a href=\"/wiki/Crimson_Draughts\" title=\"Crimson Draughts\">Crimson Draughts</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-78&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-83</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>What in the hells did you do to me?! My limbs are moving of their own volition, my blood boils like it's burning oil and I haven't slept for a tenday thanks to the godsdamn voices. You need to FIX THIS.\n</p><p><br>\n[The note goes on, but the rest is illegible as the handwriting is too erratic.]\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>See also:\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Open_Investigation\" title=\"Open Investigation\">Open Investigation</a></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201934\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.049 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.051 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1362/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 23583/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5673/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 935606/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   41.032      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   41.032      1 -total\n 49.90%   20.475      6 Template:Icon_text\n 44.39%   18.215     15 Template:Trim\n 23.56%    9.667      2 Template:Uid\n 16.09%    6.600      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.77%    5.652      2 Template:Template_style\n 11.27%    4.625      1 Template:Notes\n 10.95%    4.495      1 Template:PageSeo\n 10.81%    4.434      2 Template:Hidden_code\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:35123-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714201934 and revision id 238058. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}